  "description": "Demolition of single storey garage and showroom and erection of three, four and five storey block comprising of 35 x one, two and three bed flats and 4 x four bed houses with associated parking and landscaping.",
  "site_name": "210-214",
  "last_updated_by": "Northgate M3",
  "decision_target_date": "12/06/2005",
  "borough": "Hounslow",
  "postcode": null,
  "street_name": null,
